It's pretty easy.
这挺简单的。

00:54:34.989 --> 00:54:44.309
We've gotten thousands of responses and people reaching out, and it's really one of our favorite things about doing this, to just hear about this thing we created and how it's continued to affect people.
我们已经收到了成千上万的回应和听众的留言，倾听我们创造的这个东西以及它如何继续影响着人们，真的是我们做这件事最喜欢的部分之一。

00:54:44.309 --> 00:54:48.590
